  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAMAYE COOPERATIVE COCOA PRODUCTION EXPANSION PROJECT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The war in Ukraine has encouraged the increase in input costs in global agriculture, specifically in Cte d&apos;Ivoire. This situation has a direct impact on coffee, cocoa, cashew and rubber producers. This subsidy will allow the realization of the project of the organic factory of agricultural inputs such as biols, liquid liffer, Bokashi; Biochar, simple organic fertilizers that will increase producers&apos; production</narrative>
  </description>
